<1.4.0>
Fresh installs create telegram_tokens.identifier wide enough for Tebex identifiers (varchar(50) instead of int).
Telegram-number change purchases are now actually consumed when redeemed.
Contact directory pages 30 contacts at a time with a correct page count; missing/invalid page numbers no longer break the list or the telegram list.
A character's telegram number is now generated, saved and cached correctly when the character is selected.
Opening a telegram you sent no longer marks it read for the sender — read state now belongs to the receiver only.
Multi-word inbox searches work again (e.g. "Ann Smith").
Anonymous sender no longer leaks in the inbox list or read view.
Telegram export: an unrelated player can no longer export somebody else's telegram.
Allow push-to-talk while in telegram UI. Movement controls stay locked while the telegram UI is open.
/telegram chat command opens the UI (Config.TelegramCommand = false disables it).
Anonymous telegrams: the recipient sees ANON instead of the sender, cannot reply, and the export item keeps the sender hidden.
New Group Feature. Details below.

